id: SECRETS-001
title: Azure Storage Account Key
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
patterns:
  - regex: AccountKey=[A-Za-z0-9+/=]{86,88}
    message: Azure Storage Account key detected. These keys grant full access to your storage account.
fix: Rotate the key in Azure Portal > Storage Account > Access Keys. Use Azure Key Vault or managed identities instead of embedding keys in code.
